{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"story_talr_set_1_story_1","storyGroup":"story_talr_set_1","storySort":0,"storyDependence":null,"storyCanShow":0,"storyCode":null,"storyName":"体面的本分","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"翁贝托的葬礼上，许多曾经的顾客前来吊唁，一位熟人也不请自来。面对这位在叙拉古颇有影响力的大人物，卢奇诺必须做出自己的选择。","storyCanEnter":0,"storyTxt":"obt/memory/story_talr_1_1","avgTag":"幕间","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":0,"requiredStages":null,"characters":["卢奇诺","翁贝托","悲伤的顾客","老威尼斯"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":4},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/72/Avg_bg_56_g7_tailorshop.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":5},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_calm_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":6,"musicid":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":7},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":8},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4155_talr_1#3$1","duration":"1.6","id":9},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":10},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢奇诺","text":"应该没有遗漏了吧？","id":11,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ef/Avg_avg_4155_talr_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4155_talr_1#1$1","id":12},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢奇诺","text":"爷爷做完的衣服……","id":13,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_4155_talr_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4155_talr_1#1$1","id":14},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢奇诺","text":"接下来，只要按照档案铭牌上的信息联系这些顾客……嗯，还有讣告，也一起发给他们。","id":15,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_4155_talr_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4155_talr_1#3$1","id":16},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢奇诺","text":"再确认一下明天的事……休息一下最后收尾吧。","id":17,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ef/Avg_avg_4155_talr_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4155_talr_1#3$1","id":18},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢奇诺","text":"……墓园已经选好了，葬礼的场地也不用担心。","id":19,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ef/Avg_avg_4155_talr_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4155_talr_1#1$1","id":20},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢奇诺","text":"爷爷喜欢安静，这样就挺好的。","id":21,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_4155_talr_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":22},{"type":"charslot","id":23},{"type":"text","text":"年轻的裁缝将高脚凳扶正，他很久之前就不需要踩着凳子才能看到爷爷工作时的样子了。","id":24},{"type":"dialog","id":25},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":26},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":27},{"type":"charslot","id":28},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","keep":"true","amount":"0.6","fadetime":"0","id":29},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":30},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":31},{"type":"delay","time":"1","text":"","id":32},{"type":"charslot","id":33},{"type":"dialogue","name":"翁贝托","text":"卢奇诺，手不要离机针太近，会扎到你——","id":34},{"type":"charslot","id":35},{"type":"dialogue","name":"翁贝托","text":"这样推着布料向前送的时候，也要当心，不要一直盯着布而忘了手指的位置……","id":36},{"type":"charslot","id":37},{"type":"dialogue","name":"翁贝托","text":"啊哈，你又把花边拿去玩了，我正到处找呢！","id":38},{"type":"charslot","id":39},{"type":"dialogue","name":"翁贝托","text":"卢奇诺，卢——","id":40},{"type":"charslot","id":41},{"type":"dialogue","name":"翁贝托","text":"睡着了吗？","id":42},{"type":"dialog","id":43},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":44},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":45},{"type":"charslot","id":46},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","keep":"true","amount":"0","fadetime":"0","id":47},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":48},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":49},{"type":"delay","time":"1","text":"","id":50},{"type":"dialog","id":51},{"type":"charslot","id":52},{"type":"text","text":"卢奇诺踩着缝纫机的踏板，机针随着踩踏节奏上上下下，缝纫针头起伏的声音让小裁缝紧绷一天的情绪也随之放松下来。","id":53},{"type":"dialog","id":54},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4155_talr_1#10$1","duration":"1","id":55},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":56},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢奇诺","text":"果然，还是这个节奏让人安心……","id":57,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d1/Avg_avg_4155_talr_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":58},{"type":"charslot","id":59},{"type":"text","text":"他伸手抚上制衣台上的衣服，打量着它复杂的缝边，翻过铭牌，又看了一眼那个再熟悉不过的名字——“法布里齐奥·威尼斯”。","id":60},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4155_talr_1#5$1","id":61},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢奇诺","text":"这件……","id":62,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/85/Avg_avg_4155_talr_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4155_talr_1#1$1","id":63},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢奇诺","text":"反正庆典已经结束，它也不会被需要了。那些大人物也和我没关系……","id":64,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_4155_talr_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4155_talr_1#5$1","id":65},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢奇诺","text":"欸？这扣子……","id":66,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/85/Avg_avg_4155_talr_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":67},{"type":"charslot","id":68},{"type":"text","text":"礼服的缝制已经基本完成，只剩前襟处的几枚扣子仍空缺着。","id":69},{"type":"text","text":"卢奇诺仍然记得最开始和爷爷学习裁缝时，爷爷就是从缝扣子教起的。","id":70},{"type":"text","text":"扣子要出现在正确的位置，保证扣上之后衣服不会出现褶皱；扣子要缝得结实，如果掉了是一件很不体面的事。","id":71},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4155_talr_1#2$1","id":72},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢奇诺","text":"爷爷做的最后一件衣服……已经和那些人无关了。","id":73,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/39/Avg_avg_4155_talr_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":74},{"type":"charslot","id":75},{"type":"text","text":"他仔细将这套礼服用衣架撑好，收进了衣柜。","id":76},{"type":"dialog","id":77},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":78},{"type":"charslot","id":79},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/72/Avg_bg_56_g7_tailorshop.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":80},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":81},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":82},{"type":"delay","time":"2","text":"","id":83},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_696_1#1$1","id":84},{"type":"dialogue","name":"悲伤的顾客","text":"您看，我结婚时的礼服就是老翁贝托做的。我还想着我女儿结婚时，再和他订一套……请您节哀。","id":85,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_696_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4155_talr_1#10$1","id":86},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢奇诺","text":"我想爷爷也会很期待您女儿的婚礼的。","id":87,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d1/Avg_avg_4155_talr_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4155_talr_1#10$1","id":88},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢奇诺","text":"他经常和我说，婚礼和葬礼一样，都是人生的重要场合。","id":89,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d1/Avg_avg_4155_talr_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4155_talr_1#10$1","id":90},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢奇诺","text":"感谢您特意从蒙特卢佩赶来……","id":91,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d1/Avg_avg_4155_talr_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_696_1#1$1","id":92},{"type":"dialogue","name":"悲伤的顾客","text":"我接到讣告就出门了，希望能赶在他下葬前为他献上一束花。","id":93,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_696_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_696_1#1$1","id":94},{"type":"dialogue","name":"悲伤的顾客","text":"它们比不过新沃尔西尼那些大花店的品种，请别嫌弃，这些是在我和妻子婚后一起经营的小花园里种的。","id":95,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_696_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_696_1#1$1","id":96},{"type":"dialogue","name":"悲伤的顾客","text":"我曾经只是个小混混，遇见了她我才决定开始一段新生活。","id":97,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_696_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_696_1#1$1","id":98},{"type":"dialogue","name":"悲伤的顾客","text":"求婚过后，婚礼让我发了愁，我没有那么多钱定制一套礼服。","id":99,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_696_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_696_1#1$1","id":100},{"type":"dialogue","name":"悲伤的顾客","text":"我万万没想到，当时最忙碌的德蒙塔诺，愿意为我做一套……要知道灰厅那些大人物都——","id":101,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_696_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_696_1#1$1","id":102},{"type":"dialogue","name":"悲伤的顾客","text":"抱歉，我话太多了。我只想表达感谢，要不是老翁贝托，我也没法过上真正体面的生活……","id":103,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_696_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_696_1#1$1","id":104},{"type":"dialogue","name":"悲伤的顾客","text":"老翁贝托，对我们一家来说，就是“大人物”……","id":105,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_696_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":106},{"type":"charslot","id":107},{"type":"text","text":"悲伤的顾客握住卢奇诺的手，那双手温暖粗糙，掌心还有没洗干净的泥土，是属于常年在花园工作的人的手。","id":108},{"type":"text","text":"卢奇诺下意识地看向对方的领口和衣扣，领口整洁，洗得褪色；扣子重新加固了一次——","id":109},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4155_talr_1#10$1","id":110},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢奇诺","text":"谢谢您。爷爷也说过，“体面”不只是大人物的事。大到一整套衣服，小到扣子眼上的缝线，都非常重要。","id":111,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d1/Avg_avg_4155_talr_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4155_talr_1#10$1","id":112},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢奇诺","text":"您带来的花很美，我想爷爷也会喜欢的。","id":113,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d1/Avg_avg_4155_talr_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":114},{"type":"charslot","id":115},{"type":"text","text":"在卢奇诺的记忆里，德蒙塔诺裁缝店从没有来过这么多客人。","id":116},{"type":"text","text":"往常，预约的客人会在规定时间内一位位到来，他跟着爷爷学习待人接物，礼貌地在门口送别上一位客人，再迎来下一位客人。","id":117},{"type":"text","text":"下雨的时候，入门处的刀剑筒里插着的雨伞也不会超过两把。","id":118},{"type":"text","text":"德蒙塔诺有自己的秩序，翁贝托在的时候，他所维持的秩序将卢奇诺保护得很好。","id":119},{"type":"text","text":"今天在这家店里，许多顾客不是来裁衣，而是来为老翁贝托送行。","id":120},{"type":"text","text":"卢奇诺整理过爷爷的设计图，大约有百余套，在前来吊唁的人群中，他一眼就认出了许多爷爷做的衣服。","id":121},{"type":"text","text":"他曾经无比期待能为一位大人物服务，但爷爷似乎从不在意这些，只要有人来定做一套体面的衣装，德蒙塔诺就会接下订单。","id":122},{"type":"text","text":"店内最后一位吊唁的客人准备离开时，外面传来了隆隆的雷声。","id":123},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4155_talr_1#5$1","id":124},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢奇诺","text":"请等一下！要下雨了，您拿上这把伞吧。","id":125,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/85/Avg_avg_4155_talr_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4155_talr_1#5$1","id":126},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢奇诺","text":"欸……","id":127,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/85/Avg_avg_4155_talr_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":128},{"type":"charslot","id":129},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":130},{"type":"text","text":"又一把长伞被插在了刀剑筒里。来人拄着一根粗糙的木手杖，怀里抱着一束包装精美的鲜花。","id":131},{"type":"dialog","id":132},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","duration":"2","id":133},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":134},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4155_talr_1#5$1","id":135},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢奇诺","text":"先生？","id":136,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/85/Avg_avg_4155_talr_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","id":137},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"希望我的不请自来没有给你造成困扰。我来看望一个老朋友。","id":138,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4155_talr_1#10$1","id":139},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢奇诺","text":"……请进。","id":140,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d1/Avg_avg_4155_talr_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":141},{"type":"charslot","id":142},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$mist_n_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_mist_n_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":143,"musicid":1},{"type":"text","text":"意料之外的客人到来，卢奇诺还是熟练地为他脱下外套，挂在衣架上，不忘抚平细微的褶皱。老翁贝托教的一切，他都没有忘记。","id":144},{"type":"text","text":"明明是第一次到访，客人却很熟悉这里。他打量着店内的布置，目光落在面料展示柜上。","id":145},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#3$1","id":146},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"在蒙特卢佩时，这种廉价布料很少会出现在店里。","id":147,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","id":148},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"搬来新沃尔西尼的这些日子，店里生意还好吗，孩子？","id":149,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4155_talr_1#10$1","id":150},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢奇诺","text":"先生，订单还是有的。维持生计不成问题。","id":151,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d1/Avg_avg_4155_talr_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","id":152},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"也是。毕竟你爷爷曾经是个让其他家族闻风丧胆的“大人物”。","id":153,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#2$1","id":154},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"这种天气，适合喝杯热茶。你觉得呢？","id":155,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":156},{"type":"charslot","id":157},{"type":"text","text":"卢奇诺这才想起，自己忘记了给来客准备饮品，他匆忙打开放茶叶的柜子，里面摆放着翁贝托未拆封的、琳琅满目的茶。","id":158},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4155_talr_1#5$1","id":159},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢奇诺","text":"威尼斯先生喜欢的茶……爷爷没说过……","id":160,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/85/Avg_avg_4155_talr_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":161},{"type":"charslot","id":162},{"type":"text","text":"老威尼斯已经坐在了沙发上，手杖握在手里，有节奏地敲击了两下，似乎已经看穿了小裁缝的手忙脚乱。","id":163},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#3$1","id":164},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"混合草本茶。","id":165,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4155_talr_1#5$1","id":166},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢奇诺","text":"这样就可以吗？","id":167,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/85/Avg_avg_4155_talr_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","id":168},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"只是一杯茶而已，翁贝托应该留了很多。","id":169,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4155_talr_1#10$1","id":170},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢奇诺","text":"好的……","id":171,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d1/Avg_avg_4155_talr_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","id":172},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"自他从蒙特卢佩搬走后，我还是第一次来他的店。现在，应该是你的店了。","id":173,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","id":174},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"真怀念啊，一切都还是在蒙特卢佩时的样子。","id":175,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4155_talr_1#10$1","id":176},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢奇诺","text":"爷爷说，习惯了家具从前的位置，所以没有变动。","id":177,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d1/Avg_avg_4155_talr_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","id":178},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"他把你照顾得很好，连花都养得很好。这种花非常娇贵，但是你看，它们已经开花了。","id":179,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4155_talr_1#10$1","id":180},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢奇诺","text":"是的，先生，爷爷很爱护它们，也教了我养护花卉的方法。","id":181,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d1/Avg_avg_4155_talr_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","id":182},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"倒是显得我这束花不那么出色了。","id":183,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4155_talr_1#5$1","id":184},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢奇诺","text":"没有这回事！您……要去看看他吗？","id":185,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/85/Avg_avg_4155_talr_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#2$1","id":186},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"也好，就让我把这束花献给他吧。","id":187,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":188},{"type":"charslot","id":189},{"type":"text","text":"法布里齐奥·威尼斯上一次见到老朋友还是几天前。再上一次，是对方离开蒙特卢佩前。","id":190},{"type":"text","text":"他将手里的花放在翁贝托身边。","id":191},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","id":192},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"翁贝托来到家族的时候，和你差不多大，一转眼这么多年过去了。","id":193,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4155_talr_1#6$1","id":194},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢奇诺","text":"我……我不知道。爷爷没怎么和我说过以前的事，先生。","id":195,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3e/Avg_avg_4155_talr_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4155_talr_1#6$1","id":196},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢奇诺","text":"……他不想我和家族有过多牵扯——","id":197,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3e/Avg_avg_4155_talr_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":198},{"type":"charslot","id":199},{"type":"text","text":"小裁缝的欲言又止被年迈的威尼斯家主看在眼里。","id":200},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","id":201},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"来，我们坐下谈谈。","id":202,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4155_talr_1#6$1","id":203},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢奇诺","text":"好、好的……","id":204,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3e/Avg_avg_4155_talr_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","id":205},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"这家店刚在蒙特卢佩开始营业时，什么家具都没有，这张沙发是最早添置的。","id":206,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4155_talr_1#5$1","id":207},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢奇诺","text":"好像是爷爷的老朋友做的。","id":208,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/85/Avg_avg_4155_talr_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","id":209},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"尼可那时和翁贝托差不多大，都是在街上摸爬滚打的孩子。一个用剪刀，一个用裁皮刀，这样的好手艺流落街头是很可惜的。","id":210,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","id":211},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"手上明明有武器，却把自己弄得很狼狈。","id":212,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","id":213},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"我把他们带回了家族，给了他这家裁缝店。尼可帮他做了皮沙发。","id":214,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","id":215},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"翁贝托那时很瘦小，待人接物却谨慎得很，话不多，回答什么都是点到即止。","id":216,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","id":217},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"每次我去店里，他总是早早等在门口，没打招呼去的话，他也会立刻放下手里的活，起身迎接。","id":218,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4155_talr_1#10$1","id":219},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢奇诺","text":"爷爷腿脚还好的时候，对待每一位客人都是这样，他也是这样教我的。","id":220,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d1/Avg_avg_4155_talr_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","id":221},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"礼貌会让对方放松警惕，这是翁贝托做事养成的习惯。他接订单的时候从不多问，只会默默将单子折起来放进口袋。","id":222,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":223},{"type":"charslot","id":224},{"type":"text","text":"卢奇诺想起爷爷折纸的习惯，他总是看不清爷爷手指的动作，但折起的纸总是对得很齐，折痕也很深。","id":225},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4155_talr_1#5$1","id":226},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢奇诺","text":"爷爷他……从没有拒绝过“订单”吗？","id":227,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/85/Avg_avg_4155_talr_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","id":228},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"他拒绝过来德蒙塔诺做衣服的客人吗？","id":229,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4155_talr_1#2$1","id":230},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢奇诺","text":"不，除了那些不礼貌的客人。","id":231,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/39/Avg_avg_4155_talr_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#2$1","id":232},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"说明新沃尔西尼的人只把他当成一个普通裁缝，这样也好。","id":233,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","id":234},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"在你父亲出生后，他就渐渐不再接“订单”了。","id":235,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4155_talr_1#5$1","id":236},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢奇诺","text":"您……您不怪罪他吗？","id":237,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/85/Avg_avg_4155_talr_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#3$1","id":238},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"一开始总会不习惯。就像用惯了一把锋利的剪刀，有一天突然找不到了。","id":239,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4155_talr_1#6$1","id":240},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢奇诺","text":"啊……","id":241,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3e/Avg_avg_4155_talr_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#3$1","id":242},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"但这把剪刀已经做出了许多得体的衣服，没有一件让我失望。在它履行剪裁义务的时候，一次也没有伤到我的手。","id":243,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#2$1","id":244},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"找不到它的时候，只会觉得有些遗憾。哪怕不用它剪东西，也希望还能看到它。","id":245,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":246},{"type":"charslot","id":247},{"type":"text","text":"卢奇诺安静地听着，他始终无法把“锋利”这样的词和爷爷联系到一起。","id":248},{"type":"text","text":"虽然爷爷在传授手艺的时候很严格，但爷爷看向自己的眼神，总是温和的。","id":249},{"type":"text","text":"但他也知道，老威尼斯口中那把锋利的剪刀是存在的，而且长时间保持着锋芒。","id":250},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","id":251},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"对我的回答还满意吗，孩子？","id":252,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4155_talr_1#6$1","id":253},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢奇诺","text":"我……","id":254,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3e/Avg_avg_4155_talr_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4155_talr_1#6$1","id":255},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢奇诺","text":"爷爷不让我多和家族的人打交道，能知道这些已经很足够——","id":256,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3e/Avg_avg_4155_talr_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","id":257},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"但还不够，是吗？","id":258,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":259},{"type":"charslot","id":260},{"type":"text","text":"卢奇诺将眼神从老威尼斯身上移开。","id":261},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","id":262},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"你的眼睛和他的很像，但翁贝托不会做出这样的表情。这样的眼神，出刀会犹豫。","id":263,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","id":264},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"安东尼奥已经为他做的事付出了应有的代价。","id":265,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","id":266},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"你看，就算是我悉心教导的安东，也把握不好做事的尺度。而翁贝托从来不会。","id":267,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","id":268},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"他为我做的第一件礼服，有一枚暗扣错了位，导致礼服起了可笑的褶皱。没等我说话，他就干脆利落地挑断了缝扣线，又迅速缝了新的。","id":269,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","id":270},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"他也像一枚暗扣，只会出现在用得上的位置，缝得结实不会移位，也不会喧宾夺主抢了明扣的风采。","id":271,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","id":272},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"我的礼服需要这样的扣子。你是翁贝托的孙子，我很欣赏你，卢奇诺。我可以给你一个位置。","id":273,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","id":274},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"一份适合你的差事，你可以为各种大人物做衣服，随你喜欢。","id":275,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","id":276},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"你不会让德蒙塔诺蒙尘。","id":277,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":278},{"type":"charslot","id":279},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":280},{"type":"text","text":"卢奇诺每一个字都听进去了，但他没有立刻给出回应。","id":281},{"type":"text","text":"他觉得自己会永远记住那场庆典，以及在陆行舰上看到的一切。这种古老的叙拉古秩序，依然在若有似无地影响着这座新的移动城市。","id":282},{"type":"text","text":"老威尼斯的手掌轻轻落在他瘦弱的肩膀上，带着不容抗拒的力量。","id":283},{"type":"text","text":"但一定有什么是现在的自己能做的。","id":284},{"type":"text","text":"德蒙塔诺年轻的继承人扶住制衣台沉默良久，他看见爷爷伏在桌面上，一枚枚教他对比扣子的异同。","id":285},{"type":"text","text":"他看到爷爷耐心地教他如何将一枚扣子完美地固定在衣服上，怎么缝边最平整。","id":286},{"type":"text","text":"他从一个只会扎破手指的孩子，变得越来越熟练，最终成为一个对缝纫有肌肉记忆的裁缝。","id":287},{"type":"text","text":"他也和爷爷学会了如何不怠慢任何一位顾客，如何根据他们的形象设计一套适合对方的衣服，如何提出建议而不会惹恼他们……","id":288},{"type":"text","text":"做自己该做的事，不去问多余的问题，保持最合适的距离，清楚什么才是立身之本。","id":289},{"type":"text","text":"卢奇诺像终于下定决心一般抬起了头。","id":290},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4155_talr_1#10$1","id":291},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢奇诺","text":"……先生，请允许我拒绝您的好意。我想追随爷爷最后的选择，靠自己的裁缝技术在新沃尔西尼立足。","id":292,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d1/Avg_avg_4155_talr_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4155_talr_1#10$1","id":293},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢奇诺","text":"您看，我的缝纫技术还不是很成熟，虽然爷爷教我的足够多，但我仍需要时间去实践。","id":294,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d1/Avg_avg_4155_talr_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4155_talr_1#1$1","id":295},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢奇诺","text":"爷爷留下的招牌不能砸在我手里。我能做的，就是守好这间小小的裁缝铺。","id":296,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_4155_talr_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":297},{"type":"charslot","id":298},{"type":"text","text":"他感到一阵眩晕，随后深吸了一口气，压抑了几天的悲伤情绪，变成了付之于口的决心。","id":299},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$hope_g2_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_hope_g2_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":300,"musicid":2},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4155_talr_1#2$1","id":301},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢奇诺","text":"我……惹过不少麻烦。我确实曾经向往您这样的家族“大人物”，但我连自己的麻烦都要靠爷爷解决。","id":302,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/39/Avg_avg_4155_talr_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4155_talr_1#2$1","id":303},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢奇诺","text":"您说过，希望我不要留下遗憾，照顾好爷爷，但我没有做到。连这种事都做不到，我为什么还要想着成为什么“大人物”？","id":304,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/39/Avg_avg_4155_talr_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4155_talr_1#2$1","id":305},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢奇诺","text":"爷爷总跟我说，一套体面的衣服给客人的不仅是外表的得体，或许真的能让穿上它的人，开启新的生活——","id":306,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/39/Avg_avg_4155_talr_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4155_talr_1#8$1","id":307},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢奇诺","text":"我希望让德蒙塔诺以“能做出让客人满意的衣服”这样的口碑，在新沃尔西尼立足。","id":308,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8e/Avg_avg_4155_talr_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4155_talr_1#8$1","id":309},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢奇诺","text":"——靠我自己的缝纫手艺。","id":310,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8e/Avg_avg_4155_talr_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#6$1","id":311},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"这是你的决心吗？","id":312,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/41/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4155_talr_1#8$1","id":313},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢奇诺","text":"是的，先生。","id":314,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8e/Avg_avg_4155_talr_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":315},{"type":"charslot","id":316},{"type":"text","text":"年轻的裁缝说完这些话，紧张地低下了头。他的心已经快要跃出喉咙。","id":317},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#2$1","id":318},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"那么，德蒙塔诺现在依然在营业，依然可以为我完成一套礼服？","id":319,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":320},{"type":"charslot","id":321},{"type":"text","text":"卢奇诺错愕地抬起头，他以为这位大人物会恼怒，但对方只是云淡风轻地问了一个看似毫不相关的问题。","id":322},{"type":"text","text":"或许也不是毫不相关。","id":323},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","id":324},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"我几天前在德蒙塔诺定做了一套衣服。","id":325,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4155_talr_1#5$1","id":326},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢奇诺","text":"啊，是那套……","id":327,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/85/Avg_avg_4155_talr_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","id":328},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"我想，德蒙塔诺的主理人应该不会搁置顾客的订单吧。","id":329,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":330},{"type":"charslot","id":331},{"type":"text","text":"卢奇诺的神色窘迫起来。","id":332},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","id":333},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"我理解你的顾虑。这套衣服确实没有在最该被穿上的时候送到顾客身边，但这不代表它没有被做完的必要。","id":334,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","id":335},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"它只是一套衣服，和家族那些事务无关。这里以后只会是一间裁缝店，和家族也无关。","id":336,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","id":337},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"今天我不是家主，也不是翁贝托的老友。把我当成一个普通的客人，去做你该做的吧。","id":338,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4155_talr_1#3$1","id":339},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢奇诺","text":"您的套装……爷爷去世前已经做得差不多了，只差扣子的部分了。","id":340,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ef/Avg_avg_4155_talr_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","id":341},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"正好，我今天带了几枚旧扣子。","id":342,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4155_talr_1#5$1","id":343},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢奇诺","text":"欸？","id":344,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/85/Avg_avg_4155_talr_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":345},{"type":"charslot","id":346},{"type":"text","text":"老威尼斯从胸前的口袋里取出几枚用手帕包裹的金色扣子。","id":347},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4155_talr_1#5$1","id":348},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢奇诺","text":"好精致……我从没见过这种金属工艺被用在这么小的扣子上。","id":349,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/85/Avg_avg_4155_talr_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4155_talr_1#5$1","id":350},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢奇诺","text":"这是……划痕？","id":351,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/85/Avg_avg_4155_talr_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","id":352},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"很遗憾，这是很久之前留下的了——一把刺向我胸前的刀。后来我只洗掉了血迹，我找的工匠都说没法修复划痕。","id":353,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4155_talr_1#5$1","id":354},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢奇诺","text":"那这些扣子原来所在的衣服——","id":355,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/85/Avg_avg_4155_talr_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","id":356},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"已经破得不能再穿了。真可惜，那是翁贝托为我做的第一套礼服。","id":357,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4155_talr_1#5$1","id":358},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢奇诺","text":"是那套暗扣错了位的……","id":359,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/85/Avg_avg_4155_talr_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","id":360},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"现在我想请你，德蒙塔诺的现任店主，为我最新的套装缝上这几枚扣子。","id":361,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4155_talr_1#5$1","id":362},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢奇诺","text":"您为什么会知道这套衣服缺少扣子？","id":363,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/85/Avg_avg_4155_talr_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","id":364},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"这是翁贝托做衣服的习惯，他总会把缝扣子留在最后一步。扣紧纽扣，才是一套体面衣服彻底完成的标志。","id":365,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4155_talr_1#10$1","id":366},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢奇诺","text":"爷爷……我明白了，请您把扣子交给我，我做好之后送到——","id":367,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d1/Avg_avg_4155_talr_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","id":368},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"不，不必如此。我想来吊唁的人已经都离开了。今天时间也宽裕，我可以在这里等你完成。","id":369,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":370},{"type":"charslot","id":371},{"type":"text","text":"卢奇诺从衣柜里取出翁贝托生前做的最后一套衣服，在制衣台上展平，将金扣子一枚枚放在空缺的位置。","id":372},{"type":"dialog","id":373},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":374},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":375},{"type":"charslot","id":376},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","keep":"true","amount":"0.6","fadetime":"0","id":377},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":378},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":379},{"type":"delay","time":"1","text":"","id":380},{"type":"charslot","id":381},{"type":"dialogue","name":"翁贝托","text":"卢奇诺，像这种装饰扣，要把线穿过背后的孔，尽量多缝几圈，一定要结实。","id":382},{"type":"charslot","id":383},{"type":"dialogue","name":"翁贝托","text":"会选这种扣子的客人，很注重体面，扣子掉了的话，是很不得体的。","id":384},{"type":"charslot","id":385},{"type":"dialogue","name":"翁贝托","text":"看，这样就缝好了，很简单吧？","id":386},{"type":"charslot","id":387},{"type":"dialogue","name":"翁贝托","text":"扣子的种类还有很多，爷爷以后慢慢教给你。","id":388},{"type":"dialog","id":389},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":390},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":391},{"type":"charslot","id":392},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","keep":"true","amount":"0","fadetime":"0","id":393},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":394},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":395},{"type":"delay","time":"1","text":"","id":396},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","id":397},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":398},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢奇诺","text":"要选和衣服颜色相近的线，多缝几圈……","id":399},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢奇诺","text":"爷爷说过很多次了，以前他总会把最后的收尾工作留给我，虽然基础，但很重要。","id":400},{"type":"dialog","id":401},{"type":"charslot","id":402},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","duration":"2","id":403},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":404},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"你以前也是这样，任何细节都不会放过，总是对着台灯眯着眼睛缝东西。","id":405,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","id":406},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"结果年纪轻轻就戴上了眼镜。我揶揄你，还好你不是用铳械的，不然都瞄不准。","id":407,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","id":408},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"他的手比量体那天稳多了，翁贝托。你的孙子很好地继承了你的衣钵。","id":409,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":410},{"type":"charslot","id":411},{"type":"text","text":"看着年轻人认真的模样，他才发觉原来已经过去了这么多年。","id":412},{"type":"text","text":"恍惚中他又看到了自己救回的小裁缝，笨拙地为他量体，为了赶制套装彻夜不眠。他记得自己递给小裁缝那把剪刀时对方的眼神。","id":413},{"type":"text","text":"如今，他也会记得那个与翁贝托相似的年轻人拒绝自己的眼神。","id":414},{"type":"dialog","id":415},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4155_talr_1#10$1","duration":"1","id":416},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":417},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢奇诺","text":"扣子缝好了，先生。您试一下合不合身，我再做一下微调。镜子在这边——","id":418,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d1/Avg_avg_4155_talr_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#3$1","id":419},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"嗯，我知道，老位置。","id":420,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":421},{"type":"charslot","id":422},{"type":"text","text":"老威尼斯走到试衣台上，打量着镜中的人，他发觉自己已经老了。","id":423},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","id":424},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"我变了很多，但他做的衣服永远合身。","id":425,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4155_talr_1#10$1","id":426},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢奇诺","text":"嗯……看起来没有什么要修改的了。","id":427,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d1/Avg_avg_4155_talr_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4155_talr_1#10$1","id":428},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢奇诺","text":"您别动，我再帮您修剪一下线头。请抬一下胳膊。","id":429,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d1/Avg_avg_4155_talr_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","id":430},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"好。","id":431,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":432},{"type":"charslot","id":433},{"type":"text","text":"能靠近这位老家主而让他毫无戒心的人屈指可数，敢拿着剪刀在他要害部位比划的，从前有一位，现在多了一位。","id":434},{"type":"text","text":"不是所谓的“剪裁师”，只是一个会为客人用心工作的裁缝。","id":435},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#7$1","id":436},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"你会是个好裁缝的，卢奇诺。","id":437,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1e/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4155_talr_1#10$1","id":438},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢奇诺","text":"嗯，我只是个裁缝，也会像爷爷一样，成为足够支撑德蒙塔诺招牌的裁缝。","id":439,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d1/Avg_avg_4155_talr_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":440},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":441},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":442},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":443},{"type":"charslot","id":444},{"type":"image","id":445}],"characters":["卢奇诺","翁贝托","悲伤的顾客","老威尼斯"]}